The CSV files were obtained from the original cora.arff available at:
https://www.cs.utexas.edu/~ml/riddle/data.html.

* cora1_ids contains distinct (clean-clean) records with unique IDs
* cora1_cluster_mapping contains the original clusters inferred from the 'class'
  attribute of the original dataset
* cora1_mapping contains the ideal mapping for record linkage/duplicate
  detection obtained by providing the combinations of matching pairs based on
  the cora1 cluster mapping
